sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as rhods-operator /<br/>opendatahub-operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Operator as Workbenches Operator<br/>(controller-runtime)
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Renderer<br/>(in-memory)
    participant ConfigMap as odh-workbenches-config<br/>ConfigMap
    participant HWWebhook as HardwareProfile Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant ConnWebhook as Connection Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant HWPCR as HardwareProfile CR
    participant OSApi as OpenShift APIServer CR

    Note over Platform,Operator: Flow 1: Workbenches CR Reconciliation

    Platform->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Workbenches CR<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Platform->>K8sAPI: Write odh-workbenches-config ConfigMap<br/>(platformVersion, distribution)
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch event: Workbenches CR changed<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Read odh-workbenches-config ConfigMap<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: ConfigMap data (platformVersion, name, version)
    Operator->>Kustomize: Render manifests (kf-notebook-ctrl,<br/>odh-notebook-ctrl, imagestreams)
    Kustomize-->>Operator: Rendered manifests with injected params<br/>(gateway-url, images, namespace)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply patches<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, field ownership
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Applied resources
    Operator->>K8sAPI: List Deployments (status check)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Deployment status (available replicas)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Update Workbenches CR status<br/>(phase, conditions, releases)

    Note over K8sAPI,HWWebhook: Flow 2: HardwareProfile Webhook Injection

    K8sAPI->>HWWebhook: POST /workbenches-hardware-profile<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS, API server webhook auth<br/>AdmissionReview (Notebook create/update)
    HWWebhook->>K8sAPI: GET HardwareProfile CR<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>HWWebhook: HardwareProfile spec<br/>(resources, nodeSelector, tolerations)
    HWWebhook-->>K8sAPI: AdmissionResponse with JSON patches<br/>(inject resources, nodeSelector, tolerations)

    Note over K8sAPI,ConnWebhook: Flow 3: Connection Secret Injection

    K8sAPI->>ConnWebhook: POST /workbenches-connection-notebook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS, API server webhook auth<br/>AdmissionReview (Notebook create/update)
    ConnWebhook->>K8sAPI: GET Secret (existence check)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, APIReader
    K8sAPI-->>ConnWebhook: Secret exists
    ConnWebhook->>K8sAPI: Create SubjectAccessReview<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, ServiceAccount token<br/>(check user can GET secret)
    K8sAPI-->>ConnWebhook: SAR result (allowed/denied)
    ConnWebhook-->>K8sAPI: AdmissionResponse with JSON patches<br/>(inject envFrom secretRef entries)

    Note over Operator,OSApi: TLS Profile Lifecycle

    Operator->>K8sAPI: Watch OpenShift APIServer CR<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: TLS security profile (ciphers, minVersion)
    Note over Operator: On TLS profile change:<br/>graceful shutdown + restart
